# Check text out with LF on every platform. Validator scores hash source and case files byte for
# byte (benchmarks/runner.py `_validator_src_hasher`), so a CRLF checkout on Windows computes a
# different validator_sha from CI's LF checkout and reads a current score as stale.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.FCStd binary
*.png binary
*.stl binary
*.3mf binary
*.enc binary
